    "max_clock_skew_seconds": 300,
    "min_timestamp_unix": 1000000000,
    "max_timestamp_unix": 4102444800,
    "_comment": [
      "The magnitude is validated against these absolute bounds BEFORE the",
      "value is used in any arithmetic, and the skew is computed on plain",
      "int64 seconds. Deriving a time value first and folding the sign of the",
      "difference does not close the window at the ends of the representable",
      "range: a validly signed request with timestamp 253402300799 was",
      "accepted and never expired. Until vizra-search owns a nonce store this",
      "window is the ONLY replay bound."
    ]
  },
